    reconstructionNotes: "VanHall52 registered VBO spans three1913 schoolBAGparents, authored as whole physical twin-school/gym complex. Original PubliekeWerken1913facade drawing and creator2011courtyard photographs substantiate three-storey brick elevations and white-painted Cavia lower frontage. Separate residential gateway arch row excluded; all mapped recesses retained. Cinema first floor on right side of courtyard, above gym per official visitor directions."
